] | 2022-10-25 DID NOT VOTE: Online Streaming Act – C-11 – Second Reading | VOTE NAY: 2022-05-31 Government Motion no. 42 – Pre-Study of Bill C-11, Online Streaming Ac (Adopted) [never places: Procedure, not substance.]

